---
import MissionLayout from '../../layouts/MissionLayout.astro';
---

<MissionLayout
  slug="verity-east-africa"
  heading="Verity East Africa Reforestation"
  status="Kenya project · public campaign"
  statusHref="https://www.veritynature.com/lukenya2024"
  heroImage="/assets/projects/verity-01.avif"
  explorerGradient="linear-gradient(160deg, #0c1a06 0%, #1a2d10 100%)"
>
  <section class="case-section">
    <h2 class="case-section-title">1. The TL;DR <span class="case-section-sub">(Executive Summary)</span></h2>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">The Purpose</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">Help communities take part in large-scale reforestation by connecting tree-planting initiatives with digital products for participation, field operations, and transparent project tracking. The work supports Verity Nature's wider mission to restore degraded landscapes with local communities.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">The Problem</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">Reforestation at landscape scale depends on coordinated work on the ground. Community participation, activity in remote areas, and credible records of project progress all need to connect; isolated planting activity is difficult to coordinate and verify over time.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">The Solution</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">A community planting app, admin dashboard, and executive reporting dashboard designed and developed as a connected suite to support tree registration, planting verification, mapping, field data capture, and community participation.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">The Impact</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">A public Verity campaign page invites people to plant a tree with the organization, and the Kenya initiative is described in a video as aiming to plant 4 billion trees. That figure is an ambition, not a verified planting result; the public sources reviewed do not report a completed tree count or product adoption metrics.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-section">
    <h2 class="case-section-title">2. Strategy &amp; Discovery</h2>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Insight</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">Restoration is a long-running, place-based effort, not a one-off planting event. The product experience needed to connect people who want to contribute with the local teams delivering the work, while supporting credible monitoring beyond the initial action.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Stakeholders</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">The work brought together product and technology teams, Verity's East Africa operations, and local communities. Verity's public materials describe its projects as being designed and delivered in partnership with local people, with a Kenya office opened on April 10, 2024.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Supervisor (CTO)</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value"><a class="case-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/justinbaird/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Justin Baird</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Constraint</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">Field work takes place in remote environments, where reliable data capture and continuity matter. Verity describes developing ruggedised field systems, applications, and hardware to collect observations where connectivity and conventional office workflows cannot be assumed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-section">
    <h2 class="case-section-title">3. Execution <span class="case-section-sub">(The &ldquo;How&rdquo;)</span></h2>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Key Decision</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">Treat reforestation as an end-to-end workflow rather than a standalone tree-planting counter: community participation and planting records connect to operational oversight and executive reporting.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">My Role</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">I split my time evenly between Product Manager and Lead Product Designer, leading product definition and design across the connected suite. Verity's public-facing experience introduces the initiative as “Plant a Tree with Verity Nature”; its broader technology toolkit includes field applications and hardware, alongside Verity Carbon, its digital measurement, reporting, and verification platform.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Product Suite</h3>
      <ul class="case-field-list">
        <li><strong>Community planting app:</strong> tree registration, planting verification, mapping, field data capture, and community participation.</li>
        <li><strong>Admin dashboard:</strong> an operational view supporting administration of the planting program.</li>
        <li><strong>Executive reporting dashboard:</strong> a reporting view for program progress and decision-making.</li>
        <li><strong>Wider Verity technology context:</strong> Verity describes field applications and hardware for remote project work, and Verity Carbon for end-to-end measurement, reporting, and verification across nature-based carbon projects.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Publications &amp; Project Links</h3>
      <ul class="case-field-list">
        <li><a class="case-link" href="https://www.veritynature.com/lukenya2024" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Plant a Tree with Verity Nature ↗</a></li>
        <li><a class="case-link" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sU6bLNuEsvc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">How Verity Nature is Planting 4 BILLION Trees in Kenya ↗</a></li>
        <li><a class="case-link" href="https://www.veritynature.com/news/verity-kenya-office-opening" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Verity Kenya Office Opening ↗</a></li>
        <li><a class="case-link" href="https://www.veritynature.com/news/verity-technology-toolbox-case-study" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Verity Technology Toolbox Case Study ↗</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-section">
    <h2 class="case-section-title">4. Outcome &amp; Lessons</h2>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">KPIs</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">The published campaign describes an ambition to plant 4 billion trees in Kenya. Planting totals, survival rates, participant numbers, and platform adoption figures are not available, so the ambition is not presented as a measured outcome.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Post-Launch</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">Verity's public materials emphasize local partnership, end-to-end project delivery, field-ready technology, and transparent monitoring. The Kenya office opening marked a step toward closer regional operations and collaboration.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-field">
      <h3 class="case-field-label">Next Steps</h3>
      <p class="case-field-value">Continue improving the community, field, and reporting workflows with feedback from local participants and operations teams. As verified project data becomes available, make planting, survival, and participation outcomes visible across operational and executive reporting.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</MissionLayout>
